sequenceDiagram
    participant App as main.py
    participant OS as OS / File System
    participant CSV as CSV File

    App->>App: current_date = datetime.now().strftime('%Y_%m_%d')
    App->>OS: os.makedirs('marked_attendance/' + current_date, exist_ok=True)
    
    App->>OS: Check if CSV exists
    alt Does not exist
        App->>CSV: Create new file & write headers
    end
    
    App->>OS: cv.imwrite(image_path, face_crop)
    App->>CSV: open(csv_file_path, mode='a')
    App->>CSV: writer.writerow([Name, UUID, Timestamp, Image_Path])
